Subject: timezone: copy aliases on WASIX
Last-Update: 2026-09-27

Wasmer keeps symbolic links in memory instead of writing them into the
mounted build directory. Use zic's file-copy fallback so timezone aliases
survive the generator's exit and are included in the assembled service.

diff --git a/src/timezone/zic.c b/src/timezone/zic.c
--- a/src/timezone/zic.c
+++ b/src/timezone/zic.c
@@ -18,6 +18,11 @@

 #include "private.h"
 #include "tzfile.h"
+
+#ifdef __wasi__
+/* Persist timezone aliases through the file-copy fallback. */
+#undef HAVE_SYMLINK
+#endif

 #define	ZIC_VERSION_PRE_2013 '2'
 #define	ZIC_VERSION	'3'
